---
interface Props {
  lang?: string;
}

const routeLang = (Astro.locals as Record<string, any>)?.starlightRoute?.lang;
const lang = Astro.props.lang || routeLang || 'en';
const isFr = lang === 'fr';
---

<div class="site-orientation not-content">
  <div class="orientation-header">
    <span class="orientation-badge">
      {isFr ? 'Manuel de référence' : 'Documentation Manual'}
    </span>
    <p class="orientation-byline">
      {isFr ? (
        <span>Par <a href="https://www.linkedin.com/in/carrereolivier/" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Olivier Carrère</a>, rédacteur technique &middot; <a href="https://redaction-technique.org/" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="blog-pill">Blog d'essais ↗</a></span>
      ) : (
        <span>By <a href="https://www.linkedin.com/in/carrereolivier/" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Olivier Carrère</a>, technical writer &middot; <a href="https://redaction-technique.org/" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="blog-pill">Opinion Blog ↗</a></span>
      )}
    </p>
  </div>

  <div class="orientation-body">
    <p class="orientation-mission">
      {isFr ? (
        <span><strong>Ce site est le manuel technique</strong> : le guide de référence du processus docs-as-code, de la définition du projet à la livraison. Le <a href="https://redaction-technique.org/" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">blog compagnon</a> réunit quant à lui réflexions, essais et analyses d'opinion.</span>
      ) : (
        <span><strong>This site is the technical manual</strong>: a practical guide to the docs-as-code process, from project definition to delivery. The companion <a href="https://redaction-technique.org/" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">blog</a> publishes in-depth essays, analysis, and opinion.</span>
      )}
    </p>
    <p class="orientation-context">
      {isFr ? (
        <span>Que vous choisissiez entre DITA XML et Markdown, passiez à un workflow docs-as-code ou intégriez la documentation à votre chaîne CI/CD &mdash; ces guides couvrent les méthodes, formats et outils pour faire de la documentation une pratique d'ingénierie durable et évolutive.</span>
      ) : (
        <span>Whether you're choosing between DITA XML and Markdown, migrating to a docs-as-code workflow, or integrating documentation into a CI/CD pipeline &mdash; these guides cover the methods, formats, and tools that make technical documentation a sustainable, scalable engineering practice.</span>
      )}
    </p>
  </div>
</div>

<style>
  .site-orientation {
    margin: 0 0 2.5rem 0;
    padding: 1.25rem 1.5rem;
    background: var(--sl-color-gray-6);
    border: 1px solid var(--sl-color-gray-5);
    border-left: 4px solid var(--sl-color-accent);
    border-radius: 0.5rem;
  }

  .orientation-header {
    display: flex;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: space-between;
    gap: 0.75rem;
    padding-bottom: 0.85rem;
    margin-bottom: 0.85rem;
    border-bottom: 1px solid var(--sl-color-gray-5);
  }

  .orientation-badge {
    display: inline-flex;
    align-items: center;
    font-family: var(--sl-font-mono);
    font-size: var(--sl-text-xs);
    font-weight: 600;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    letter-spacing: 0.08em;
    color: var(--sl-color-accent-high);
    background: var(--sl-color-accent-low);
    padding: 0.2rem 0.6rem;
    border-radius: 0.25rem;
  }

  .orientation-byline {
    font-size: var(--sl-text-sm);
    color: var(--sl-color-gray-3);
    margin: 0;
  }

  .orientation-byline a {
    color: var(--sl-color-white);
    text-decoration: underline;
    text-underline-offset: 2px;
  }

  .orientation-byline a:hover {
    color: var(--sl-color-text-accent);
  }

  .blog-pill {
    color: var(--sl-color-accent-high) !important;
    font-weight: 500;
  }

  .orientation-body {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 0.6rem;
  }

  .orientation-mission {
    font-size: var(--sl-text-base);
    line-height: 1.55;
    color: var(--sl-color-white);
    margin: 0;
  }

  .orientation-mission strong {
    font-weight: 600;
  }

  .orientation-mission a {
    color: var(--sl-color-accent-high);
    text-decoration: underline;
    text-underline-offset: 2px;
  }

  .orientation-context {
    font-size: var(--sl-text-sm);
    line-height: 1.55;
    color: var(--sl-color-gray-2);
    margin: 0;
  }

  @media (max-width: 48rem) {
    .site-orientation {
      padding: 1rem 1.15rem;
    }
    .orientation-header {
      flex-direction: column;
      align-items: flex-start;
      gap: 0.5rem;
    }
  }
</style>
